# Moat ("Creatures without flying can't attack", CR 508.1c) against banding: a band is formed only of creatures declared as
# attackers (CR 702.22c), so Benalish Hero, which can't attack at all, can't join Mesa Pegasus's band - banding gives no
# creature the right to attack. Bot2's Moat; Bot1's Hero is refused as an attacker, the Pegasus (flying) attacks alone, and
# with no other attacker beside it no band is asked for. It deals its 1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Benalish Hero
Mesa Pegasus
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Moat
Island x14

